                <div class="p-2">
                    <div id="introduction">
                        Sayori is a game bot developed by Shadowveil Studioz. This bot was started as beta game bot to
                        test the games before adding it to their other bot L.I.N.G.O, but the plan was changed and it
                        was decided to keep Sayori as an independed bot.
                    </div>
                    <div id="history">
                        <h2>History</h2>
                        <p>It all start in mid 2025, when Lingo was being buffed with unique features like friendship
                            and popularity. The developer <a title="Satviky" href="#">Satviky</a> wanted to add games in
                            the bot and <a title="Kaddu aka Saksham Gupta" href="#">Kaddu</a> volunteered to work on few
                            games which can later be added on
                            L.I.N.G.O. <br> It is said that once the game were ready Satviky thought that making the
                            game bot, an actual bot will be profitable and that's where the Sayori came into the
                            picture.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="features">
                        <h2>Features</h2>
                        <p>Sayori have a lot of games, divided into many categories to test the teamwork, intuition, and
                            a lot more.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div id="Games">
                        <h2>Games</h2>
                        <p>
                            Some of the most played games on Sayori are:
                        <ol>
                            <li><strong>Mafia:</strong>It is one of the social deduction games we have. It is played in
                                a group and required minimut 4 players to start. Once the game is started bot will DM
                                players their roles.
                                <ul>
                                    <li>The game starts, and mafia starts their killing spree.</li>
                                    <li>One after another players are dying. Everybody need to team up to find the
                                        mafias and eliminate them before every innocent civilian is killed.</li>
                                    <li>If the Mafia is the one one surviving then they win. If there is only one
                                        civilian left, then the victory goes to Mafias.</li>
                                    <li>Some of the civilians have special roles, letting them do cool things in the
                                        game [mostly they get to use their powers once only except doctor]</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                            <li><strong>Guess The Agent:</strong>Find the imposter and win the game. This game also have
                                multiple roles.
                                <ol>
                                    <li><strong>Agent Red:</strong> They are the imposter, but they are not aware of
                                        this.</li>
                                    <li><strong>Agent Black:</strong>They are not the imposter</li>
                                    <li><strong>Agent White:</strong>They are the imposter and they are aware of this.
                                    </li>
                                </ol>
                            </li>
                            <li><strong>Guessword:</strong>Bot choses one of the person and then they get a word in DM.
                                Hint giver explain the word to other players and whoever guesses it first, wins.</li>
                            <li>There are a lot of more games, but here was the top 3.</li>
                        </ol>
                        </p>
                    </div>
